WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.236
"Winter won't be fun without Bird," thought Kip.

2
00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:21.131
"I'll write a note to her."

3
00:00:21.132 --> 00:00:28.365
"Dear Bird, Please don't go.

4
00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:31.475
Sledding won't be fun without you.

5
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:37.879
Ice-skating won't be fun either.

6
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:42.137
Your friend, Kip."

7
00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:45.412
"I'm sorry, Kip," said Bird.

8
00:00:45.413 --> 00:00:47.984
"But I have to fly south.

9
00:00:47.985 --> 00:00:54.700
It's what birds do."

10
00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:57.018
Kip sang a song to Bird.

11
00:00:57.019 --> 00:01:00.840
"Bird! Oh, Bird! I wish that you'd stay!

12
00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:04.881
We could play in the snow every day!"

13
00:01:04.882 --> 00:01:08.050
"I'm sorry, Kip," said Bird.

14
00:01:08.051 --> 00:01:12.133
"But I have to fly south.

15
00:01:12.134 --> 00:01:41.149
It's what birds do."

16
00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:47.482
Bird was getting ready to leave.

17
00:01:47.483 --> 00:01:51.237
"I have something for you," said Kip.

18
00:01:51.238 --> 00:01:54.784
"It's my lucky acorn."

19
00:01:54.785 --> 00:01:59.988
"Aw," said Bird. "Thank you, Kip.

20
00:01:59.989 --> 00:02:06.324
It will remind me of you."

21
00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:09.774
"I'll see you in the spring," said Kip.

22
00:02:09.775 --> 00:02:12.839
"Have a great winter," said Bird.

23
00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:16.814
Bird took off and flew south.

24
00:02:16.815 --> 00:02:23.337
Kip waved good-bye.

